    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that makes sense. so if i'm writing an essay, how should i frame the critiques of originalism? people always say it's just a way for conservative judges to push a specific agenda, but i want to know if there are actual scholarly arguments against it besides just saying it's political.",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
